What are Conveyor Belts?
Conveyor belts are essential material handling systems consisting of a continuous loop of material that rotates around pulleys to transport goods efficiently over various distances. These systems range from short-distance applications within facilities to extensive setups in mining operations and airport baggage handling, where their ability to move materials continuously provides significant operational advantages over alternative transport methods.
